<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Osama bin Laden</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1957–2011</span></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Osama bin Laden was a Saudi-born militant who founded <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/al-qaeda">al-Qaeda</a> in 1988 after fighting with the mujahideen against the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/soviet-union">Soviet Union</a> in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/afghanistan">Afghanistan</a>. Sheltered by the Taliban in Afghanistan from 1996, he directed attacks including the 1998 embassy bombings in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/africa">Africa</a> and the attacks of 11 September 2001 on the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/united-states">United States</a>. United States special forces killed him in Abbottabad, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/pakistan">Pakistan</a>, in 2011.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/osama-bin-laden.jpg" alt="Osama bin Laden" width="320" height="387" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Hamid Mir · CC BY-SA 3.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Osama_bin_Laden_portrait.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
